Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Opening Skit ===
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}[CORNER: Opening Skit] Tomorrow\Nis Shiki-san's birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:07.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.84,0:00:11.08,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's a day early, but happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:12.44,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.24,0:00:17.96,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Before my birthday, I used to think it\Nwas just a numerical increase in age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.64,0:00:22.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}That's a very rational way of looking\Nat it, just like you, Shiki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.84,0:00:25.76,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}But it's not just that anymore, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:26.79,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:38.60,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's an important birthday\Nto celebrate that 'one.'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:51.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well then, Ren-senpai, it's time\Nto give Shiki-senpai 'that.'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.31,0:00:53.02,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}'That'?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.12,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.12,0:01:00.08,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}This is a present for Shiki-san\Nfrom me and Tomari-san, Team Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.88,0:01:03.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Happy birthday once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:05.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Even though it's a day early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.48,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:21.32,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}This is a chestnut-shaped brooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:23.88,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:38.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I thought you'd like it since it's\Nyour favorite food, Shiki-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.95,0:01:39.45,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:40.76,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:42.24,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:43.76,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Ren-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:44.52,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Tomari-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:48.56,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}This brooch is small and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.56,0:01:49.51,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.51,0:01:51.28,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's a simple and nice design.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:04.20,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}A sweet potato-shaped brooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.08,0:02:07.24,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Tomari-chan, you bought\None for yourself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:11.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}We were thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:13.80,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Ren-senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.32,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Is that a strawberry brooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:20.60,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}The shapes are all different,\Nbut are these matching items?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.48,0:02:23.68,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}A chestnut, a sweet\Npotato, and a strawberry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.60,0:02:34.84,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well then, shall we start the radio\Nshow wearing our matching brooches?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:36.48,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Agreed.
Comment: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Self-Introductions ===
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:51.88,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}[CORNER: Self-Introductions] Liella!\NYuigaoka Girls' High School...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.88,0:03:03.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Hello, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:03.48,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.48,0:03:04.19,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'm Sakakura Sakura, the\Nvoice of Onitsuka Tomari.
Comment: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Suggestion Box ===
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:00.31,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:01.95,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Wow, that brings back memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:04.36,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I used to do that all the\Ntime during summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:04.89,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.89,0:18:05.99,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'd just write whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.99,0:18:06.54,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I remember writing those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.54,0:18:07.26,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.86,0:18:12.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You draw pictures, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:15.06,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}But then you skip a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.06,0:18:16.72,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}And suddenly, the flower\Nis already blooming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.48,0:18:18.64,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You just summarize it all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:20.88,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}I used to look at reference\Nbooks to draw them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.96,0:18:25.00,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Nagi-chan, have your drawings been\Nlike that since elementary school?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:26.83,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:27.56,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:28.72,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.72,0:18:30.04,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh, did I improve?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:31.30,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Since elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:34.08,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Yeah, but I can draw things\Nlike morning glories.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:34.90,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:35.88,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}As long as it's not a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.60,0:18:37.28,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:38.42,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I'll have you draw one next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.42,0:18:39.24,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah, let's have her draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.24,0:18:42.55,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}But honestly, that person's drawings\Nhave gotten way better too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.55,0:18:43.26,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I think they've improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:44.32,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I really think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.32,0:18:45.60,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I was like, "Wow, this is good!"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:47.88,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Well, I've been forced to draw so\Nmuch over the last five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:49.27,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:51.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Humans really do grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:52.32,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I really like them, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:54.12,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}You draw a lot for the Liella! Club too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.12,0:18:56.75,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah. Don't we have a lot of opportunities\Nto draw for the Liella! Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:18:57.30,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:57.96,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Way too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.48,0:18:59.20,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}On purpose, on purpose, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:00.54,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.54,0:19:02.84,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Well, you're one to talk too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.84,0:19:03.39,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:06.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}No, but I don't think\NI'm good at it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.24,0:19:07.24,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I don't think I am either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:10.76,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}When did I ever say I was good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:16.68,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}A portrait?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:17.92,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, like drawing a portrait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:20.80,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I was the only one who had to\Ndo a redraw for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:21.43,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:22.62,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.62,0:19:25.22,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}They told me it was so\Nbad I had to redraw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:26.64,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Did you draw it on a later day?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:27.76,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.76,0:19:30.08,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}No, I just drew Shiki-chan normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:31.40,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Just as you imagined her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:32.02,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.02,0:19:32.88,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Was it no good?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.88,0:19:33.84,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:34.34,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:36.46,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Does that actually happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:39.56,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}If it's too terrible,\Nit can get rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.56,0:19:44.16,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}But that means all the fans who\Nsupport us know my Ren-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:47.14,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}People say it's awful, but I've\Nnever had a drawing rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:47.90,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.02,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}So yours must have\Nbeen really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.02,0:19:50.44,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It must have been even worse, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:52.84,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}What did you draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.84,0:19:55.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}No, no, I drew Shiki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.92,0:20:04.10,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Well, Nagi-chan's Ren-chan... I mean,\Nif you ask if it's good, it's a bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.10,0:20:06.60,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}But it actually looks like Ren-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.60,0:20:07.23,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:11.40,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You can tell she's drawing Ren-chan.\NMaybe yours didn't get that across?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:14.04,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Maybe they thought\Nthere was no love in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:17.22,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Now I really want to know what you drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:20.66,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Well, Shiki-chan has a\Npretty simple hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:21.44,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}It's hard, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.04,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.04,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The bangs and all that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:24.86,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}True, true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.24,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The balance was difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.24,0:20:26.74,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:28.74,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:29.72,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}It must have been tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:30.76,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Yeah, it was tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:31.92,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:33.94,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}They told me to draw it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:35.06,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Was the second time okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.06,0:20:36.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}The second time was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:48.06,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:49.10,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.82,0:20:57.56,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}I only got the OK after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.56,0:20:58.44,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.44,0:21:00.56,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}But Shiki was included, so that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:01.12,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.64,0:21:02.50,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}Did you change the style?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:04.18,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Ah, I think I did change the style.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:05.95,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}You mean you changed the form?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.95,0:21:06.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}A bit, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:16.82,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Like the kind Nako-chan draws.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.82,0:21:20.16,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}It was fine once I drew it\Nwith that kind of soft feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:21.76,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}You can actually do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:23.00,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:24.22,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}So you can do both styles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.22,0:21:24.83,Aoyama Nagisa,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,900)}That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.92,0:21:36.48,Sakakura Sakura,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,180)}Right, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:36.98,Ookuma Wakana,host,0,0,0,,{\pos(330,540)}So...
